    ✔ TC-NT-04: a failing provider is retried by the queue; the failure is an error CLASS; the last attempt publishes delivery_failed; recovery sends with the same token (99.554712ms)
    ✔ a vendor refusal (4xx) is final: failed, no queue retry, delivery_failed published (74.57075ms)
    ✔ quiet hours defer the send to when they end, restore the attempt count and queue the job (29.890279ms)
